{"seq":1,"slug":"url-shortener","title":"短链接服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/case-studies/url-shortener","wordCount":795,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"短链接服务\">短链接服务</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>短链接服务是本系列最简洁的完整案例，它把前面几张的通用手法浓缩进一个读密集型系统。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>需求驱动设计</strong>：读写比 100:1 决定了缓存优先，重定向延迟 &lt; 100ms 决定了缓存命中率是性能关键。</li>\n<li><strong>短码生成四方案</strong>：哈希截取（无额外服务但可能碰撞）、全局计数器 + Base62（无碰撞但计数器单点）、分布式 ID + Base62（无碰撞无单点但码较长）、预生成 + 分配（高性能无碰撞但需维护 Key 池）。</li>\n<li><strong>301 vs 302</strong>：301 永久重定向让浏览器缓存、减轻服务负载但无法统计后续访问；302 临时重定向每次回服务、可精确统计点击。</li>\n<li><strong>存储与扩展</strong>：Base62 的 7 位可表示 62⁷ ≈ 3.5 万亿种组合；18 亿条记录按短码哈希分片，配合过期数据分批清理。</li>\n<li><strong>核心权衡</strong>：短码越短容量越小但碰撞概率越高，统计精度与缓存效率之间需要取舍。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"需求分析\">需求分析</h2><p>设计一个类似 bit.ly 的短链接服务：用户输入一个长 URL，系统返回一个短 URL；访问短 URL 时，系统将用户重定向到原始长 URL。</p>\n<h3 id=\"功能需求\">功能需求</h3><ul>\n<li>给定一个长 URL，生成唯一的短 URL</li>\n<li>访问短 URL 时，301/302 重定向到原始 URL</li>\n<li>短链接可设置过期时间</li>\n<li>可选：自定义短链接别名</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"非功能需求\">非功能需求</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可用性</td>\n<td>99.99%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读写比</td>\n<td>100:1（读远多于写）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>重定向 &lt; 100ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据保留</td>\n<td>默认 5 年</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"量化估算\">量化估算</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const estimation = {&#10;  dailyNewUrls: 1_000_000,&#10;  readWriteRatio: 100,&#10;  dailyReads: 100_000_000,&#10;&#10;  writeQPS: Math.ceil(1_000_000 / 86400),&#10;  readQPS: Math.ceil(100_000_000 / 86400),&#10;  peakReadQPS: Math.ceil(100_000_000 / 86400) * 3,&#10;&#10;  avgUrlSize: 500,&#10;  dailyStorage: (1_000_000 * 500) / 1e9,&#10;  fiveYearStorage: ((1_000_000 * 500 * 365 * 5) / 1e12).toFixed(2) + &#39; TB&#39;,&#10;&#10;  totalUrls5Years: 1_000_000 * 365 * 5,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> estimation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dailyNewUrls: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  readWriteRatio: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dailyReads: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  writeQPS: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ceil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 86400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  readQPS: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ceil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 86400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  peakReadQPS: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ceil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 86400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  avgUrlSize: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dailyStorage: (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1e9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fiveYearStorage: ((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 365</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1e12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toFixed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ' TB'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  totalUrls5Years: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 365</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>5 年内约 18 亿条短链接。使用 Base62 编码（a-z, A-Z, 0-9），7 个字符可表示 62^7 ≈ 3.5 万亿种组合，远超需求。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"高层设计\">高层设计</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    Client[客户端] --&gt; LB[负载均衡器]&#10;    LB --&gt; API[API 服务器集群]&#10;    API --&gt; Cache[(Redis 缓存)]&#10;    Cache -.-&gt;|未命中| DB[(数据库)]&#10;    API --&gt; IDGen[ID 生成服务]\">flowchart TB\n    Client[客户端] --&gt; LB[负载均衡器]\n    LB --&gt; API[API 服务器集群]\n    API --&gt; Cache[(Redis 缓存)]\n    Cache -.-&gt;|未命中| DB[(数据库)]\n    API --&gt; IDGen[ID 生成服务]</pre><h3 id=\"核心-api\">核心 API</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CreateShortUrlRequest {&#10;  longUrl: string;&#10;  customAlias?: string;&#10;  expiresAt?: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ShortUrlResponse {&#10;  shortUrl: string;&#10;  longUrl: string;&#10;  createdAt: string;&#10;  expiresAt: string | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// POST /api/v1/urls → 创建短链接&#10;// GET /{shortCode}  → 重定向到长 URL\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CreateShortUrlRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  longUrl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  customAlias</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expiresAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ShortUrlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  shortUrl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  longUrl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  createdAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expiresAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// POST /api/v1/urls → 创建短链接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// GET /{shortCode}  → 重定向到长 URL</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"详细设计\">详细设计</h2><h3 id=\"短码生成方案\">短码生成方案</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Start[生成短码] --&gt; Q1{方案选择}&#10;    Q1 --&gt; Hash[哈希 + 截取]&#10;    Q1 --&gt; Counter[全局计数器 + Base62]&#10;    Q1 --&gt; Snowflake[分布式 ID + Base62]&#10;&#10;    Hash --&gt; H1[MD5/SHA256 → 取前 7 位 Base62]&#10;    Counter --&gt; C1[Redis INCR → Base62 编码]&#10;    Snowflake --&gt; S1[Snowflake ID → Base62 编码]\">flowchart TD\n    Start[生成短码] --&gt; Q1{方案选择}\n    Q1 --&gt; Hash[哈希 + 截取]\n    Q1 --&gt; Counter[全局计数器 + Base62]\n    Q1 --&gt; Snowflake[分布式 ID + Base62]\n\n    Hash --&gt; H1[MD5/SHA256 → 取前 7 位 Base62]\n    Counter --&gt; C1[Redis INCR → Base62 编码]\n    Snowflake --&gt; S1[Snowflake ID → Base62 编码]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>哈希截取</td>\n<td>无需额外服务</td>\n<td>可能碰撞，需要检测重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局计数器</td>\n<td>无碰撞，简单</td>\n<td>计数器是单点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式 ID</td>\n<td>无碰撞，无单点</td>\n<td>短码不够短（Snowflake 较长）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预生成 + 分配</td>\n<td>高性能，无碰撞</td>\n<td>需要维护 Key 池</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"实现-计数器-base62\">实现：计数器 + Base62</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const BASE62_CHARS = &#39;0123456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ&#39;;&#10;&#10;function encodeBase62(num: number): string {&#10;  if (num === 0) return BASE62_CHARS[0];&#10;  let result = &#39;&#39;;&#10;  while (num &gt; 0) {&#10;    result = BASE62_CHARS[num % 62] + result;&#10;    num = Math.floor(num / 62);&#10;  }&#10;  return result.padStart(7, &#39;0&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function decodeBase62(str: string): number {&#10;  let result = 0;&#10;  for (const char of str) {&#10;    result = result * 62 + BASE62_CHARS.indexOf(char);&#10;  }&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BASE62_CHARS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '0123456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> encodeBase62</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (num </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BASE62_CHARS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (num </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><spa